      "line_id": "CH02_P04_L001",
      "frame_id": "CH02_P04_F01",
      "panel_id": "p24_station_exterior",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "kind": "intro",
      "spoken_text": "Станция «Тарантул» — живой корабль-лаборатория грибной цивилизации.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch02_clips/ru/CH02_P04_L001_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.911,
      "camera_target": [
        0.5,
        0.074,
        0.123
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.0,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "3faa29f39351cf9f5203f2f01ea6d2443f648585001106c3058ae0acd6fc8342"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH02_P04_L002",
      "frame_id": "CH02_P04_F02",
      "panel_id": "p24_fungal_garden",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_023",
      "kind": "station_greeting",
      "spoken_text": "Привет, Мика! Мои друзья много рассказывали о тебе. Возможно, наша история поможет тебе найти ответы.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch02_clips/ru/CH02_P04_L002_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.471,
      "camera_target": [
        0.3,
        0.28,
        0.218
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "fd52239779257726d3bc6285c79ce0f31504daa158647093660e98159a68bb33"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH02_P04_L003",
      "frame_id": "CH02_P04_F03",
      "panel_id": "p24_factory",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_023",
      "kind": "old_civilization",
      "spoken_text": "Когда-то на Молии процветала великая цивилизация.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch02_clips/ru/CH02_P04_L003_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.206,
      "camera_target": [
        0.792,
        0.211,
        0.1
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "719e8368f4e4774aa78788f7083fe19f62bb4ccbd95a4204f42ebd9e8deeb8de"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH02_P04_L004",
      "frame_id": "CH02_P04_F04",
      "panel_id": "p24_reclaimed_city",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_023",
      "kind": "ecological_collapse",
      "spoken_text": "Но жажда ресурсов и горы отходов погубили её мир.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch02_clips/ru/CH02_P04_L004_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.362,
      "camera_target": [
        0.791,
        0.332,
        0.118
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "a556ce940dbdb22eab589ff1d5c49cbb6de6973d62b5d8631b64315e25423d4c"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH02_P04_L005",
      "frame_id": "CH02_P04_F05",
      "panel_id": "p24_fungus_portrait",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_023",
      "kind": "silence",
      "spoken_text": "Планета опустела. Казалось, жизнь на ней исчезла навсегда…",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch02_clips/ru/CH02_P04_L005_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.251,
      "camera_target": [
        0.17,
        0.488,
        0.117
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "38d7a33534ea0e71365040a60f1ceda6db8914cd3864c210034713eb82734975"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH02_P04_L006",
      "frame_id": "CH02_P04_F06",
      "panel_id": "p24_meteor",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_023",
      "kind": "meteor_ancestors",
      "spoken_text": "Позже метеорит принёс сюда наших далёких предков.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch02_clips/ru/CH02_P04_L006_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.971,
      "camera_target": [
        0.505,
        0.46,
        0.11
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "d1df7855bd25219e6669f2a67a689397d09c60901c0f00b8bda163b47e61e728"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH02_P04_L007",
      "frame_id": "CH02_P04_F07",
      "panel_id": "p24_mycelium_net",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_023",
      "kind": "network_origin",
      "spoken_text": "Они объединились в единую разумную сеть. Так родился наш народ.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch02_clips/ru/CH02_P04_L007_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.329,
      "camera_target": [
        0.501,
        0.612,
        0.14
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "83fbbb01b5605a6b052010e939c95b8f06f68f0a23eb0ee04b2872e6c359cba0"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH02_P04_L008",
      "frame_id": "CH02_P04_F08",
      "panel_id": "p24_mika_smiles",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_023",
      "kind": "new_companion",
      "spoken_text": "Я отправлю с тобой часть себя. Вместе мы попробуем раскрыть тайну шторма.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch02_clips/ru/CH02_P04_L008_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.486,
      "camera_target": [
        0.817,
